/vendor/
/.phpunit.cache/
composer.lock
# NOTE: no `.vhs/*.gif` rule here, on purpose. CI (vhs.yml) renders the
# demo tapes and COMMITS the GIFs back onto master; ignoring .vhs/*.gif
# made `git add */.vhs/*.gif` match an ignored path, so every commit run
# died on it and this lib's demo GIFs silently stopped refreshing
# (docs-review-1023 C7). The repo-wide .gitignore is the place for GIF
# policy, not the per-lib file.
